FAIL testdata/bad/run-string.yaml:4:10  PQ1010: run in step 1 is text, and run is a list

   2 | steps:
   3 |   - name: only
>  4 |     run: /usr/local/bin/extract --out /srv/data
                ^

   There is no string form. paceq starts the process itself, so it never splits a
   command on spaces, and a file name with a space or a semicolon in it stays one
   argument:

       run: ["/bin/sh", "-c", "echo done"]

   or, one element per line:

       run:
         - /usr/local/bin/extract
         - --out
         - /srv/data/raw.parquet

   paceq error PQ1010  for the full explanation
